msgid "First, install the system dependencies and configure the pip mirror."
msgstr "首先，安装系统依赖并配置 pip 镜像。"

msgid ""
"Optional: If you are working on an x86 machine or using a TorchNPU "
"development version, configure pip's `extra-index`:"
msgstr "可选：如果您在 x86 机器上工作或使用 TorchNPU 开发版本，请配置 pip 的 `extra-index`："

msgid ""
"WheelNext selects a vLLM Ascend wheel that matches the hardware from the "
"variant index. First, install and verify `uv`:"
msgstr "WheelNext 会从变体索引中选择与硬件匹配的 vLLM Ascend wheel。首先，安装并验证 `uv`："

msgid "Check the device build type:"
msgstr "检查设备构建类型："

msgid ""
"If `uv pip install` fails because of a corrupted cache or stale package "
"data, clear the uv cache before running the installation command again:"
msgstr "如果 `uv pip install` 因缓存损坏或包数据过期而失败，请在重新运行安装命令之前清除 uv 缓存："

msgid "uv cache clean"
msgstr "uv cache clean"

msgid ""
"Finally, handle `triton` and `triton-ascend` according to the hardware:"
msgstr "最后，根据硬件处理 `triton` 和 `triton-ascend`："

msgid "=== \"A2 / A3 / 950DT\""
msgstr "=== \"A2 / A3 / 950DT\""

msgid "???+ note \"Other vLLM Ascend versions\""
msgstr "???+ note \"其他 vLLM Ascend 版本\""

msgid ""
"When installing another version of `vllm-ascend`, check the repository's "
"`requirements.txt` for the corresponding `triton-ascend` version."
msgstr ""
"安装其他版本的 `vllm-ascend` 时，请查看仓库的 `requirements.txt` 以获取对应的 `triton-ascend` 版本。"

msgid "??? tip \"If pip cannot verify the Huawei Cloud mirror certificate\""
msgstr "??? tip \"如果 pip 无法验证华为云镜像证书\""

msgid ""
"The Huawei Cloud package index uses HTTPS, so `--trusted-host` is not "
"normally required. If pip reports an SSL certificate verification or "
"untrusted-host error for `mirrors.huaweicloud.com`, first update pip and the"
" operating system CA certificates, or configure the CA bundle required by "
"your network."
msgstr ""
"华为云软件包索引使用 HTTPS，因此通常不需要 `--trusted-host`。如果 pip 针对 "
"`mirrors.huaweicloud.com` 报告 SSL 证书验证错误或不受信任主机错误，请先更新 pip 和操作系统 CA "
"证书，或者配置网络所需的 CA 证书包。"

msgid ""
"As a temporary workaround on a trusted network, retry the vLLM Ascend "
"installation command with `--trusted-host mirrors.huaweicloud.com`."
msgstr ""
"在可信网络中，可采用临时解决方法：在 vLLM Ascend 安装命令中添加 `--trusted-host "
"mirrors.huaweicloud.com` 后重试。"

msgid ""
"This option tells pip to trust the host even when HTTPS validation fails, "
"which weakens protection against man-in-the-middle attacks. Use it only when"
" you trust the network and cannot fix the certificate configuration."
msgstr "此选项会让 pip 在 HTTPS 验证失败时仍信任该主机，从而削弱对中间人攻击的防护。仅当你信任当前网络且无法修复证书配置时使用。"

msgid ""
"Choose one of the following methods to install `vllm` and `vllm-ascend`. "
"PyTorch and TorchNPU are installed automatically as dependencies during this"
" step using the compatible versions for the selected release."
msgstr ""
"选择以下方法之一安装`vllm`和`vllm-"
"ascend`。在此步骤中，PyTorch和TorchNPU会作为依赖项，按所选发布版本的兼容版本自动安装。"

msgid ""
"To ensure that Triton Ascend matches the current vLLM Ascend version, remove"
" any existing `triton` and `triton-ascend` packages before installing the "
"corresponding version of `triton-ascend`:"
msgstr ""
"为确保使用与当前vLLM Ascend版本匹配的Triton Ascend，请先清理环境中已有的`triton`和`triton-"
"ascend`，再安装对应版本的`triton-ascend`："

msgid ""
"This prevents an existing Triton package or another version of Triton Ascend"
" from being mixed into the current environment."
msgstr "这样可以避免已有Triton包或其他版本的Triton Ascend与当前环境混用。"

msgid ""
"For more Triton Ascend installation guidance, see [Triton-Ascend > "
"FAQ](https://github.com/Ascend/triton-"
"ascend/blob/main/docs/en/FAQ.md#1-installation-and-environment-"
"configuration)."
msgstr ""
"有关Triton Ascend安装的更多说明，请参阅[Triton-Ascend > "
"FAQ](https://github.com/Ascend/triton-"
"ascend/blob/main/docs/en/FAQ.md#1-installation-and-environment-"
"configuration)。"

msgid "=== \"Atlas 300I DUO / Atlas 200I Pro\""
msgstr "=== \"Atlas 300I DUO / Atlas 200I Pro\""

msgid ""
"Atlas 300I DUO and Atlas 200I Pro do not support `triton` or `triton-"
"ascend`. If either package is already installed in the environment, "
"uninstall it and do not reinstall `triton-ascend`:"
msgstr ""
"Atlas 300I DUO和Atlas 200I Pro不支持`triton`或`triton-"
"ascend`。如果环境中已安装任一软件包，请将其卸载，并且不要重新安装`triton-ascend`："

msgid "??? note \"Installation method comparison\""
msgstr "??? note \"安装方式对比\""

msgid "| Method | Package type | Hardware handling | Recommended for |"
msgstr "| 安装方式 | 包类型 | 硬件适配方式 | 推荐用户 |"

msgid ""
"    | **pip** | Prebuilt wheel | Installs the standard `vllm-ascend` wheel, "
"which currently targets A2 | A2 users who want the simplest installation |"
msgstr ""
"    | **pip** | 预构建 wheel | 安装标准的 `vllm-ascend` wheel，该 wheel 目前面向 A2 | "
"希望以最简单方式安装的 A2 用户 |"

msgid ""
"    | **uv** | Prebuilt wheel | Uses WheelNext wheel variants to select a "
"compatible build for the detected hardware | Users who want a prebuilt wheel"
" selected for their hardware |"
msgstr ""
"    | **uv** | 预构建 wheel | 使用 WheelNext wheel 变体，根据检测到的硬件选择兼容构建 | "
"希望为其硬件选择预构建 wheel 的用户 |"

msgid ""
"    | **Source** | Source code | Builds and installs vLLM Ascend for the "
"current environment | Development, customization, or environments without a "
"suitable prebuilt wheel |"
msgstr ""
"    | **Source** | 源码 | 为当前环境构建并安装 vLLM Ascend | 开发、自定义或没有合适预构建 wheel 的环境 |"

msgid ""
"This installation method currently supports only **A2** builds and does not "
"automatically support A3, Atlas 300I DUO, Atlas 200I Pro, or 950DT. For "
"other hardware, use a prebuilt image, WheelNext, or a source installation."
msgstr ""
"该安装方式目前仅支持 **A2** 构建，不会自动支持 A3、Atlas 300I DUO、Atlas 200I Pro 或 "
"950DT。其他硬件请使用预构建镜像、WheelNext 或源码安装。"

msgid "???+ warning \"A3 source installation\""
msgstr "???+ warning \"A3 源码安装\""

msgid ""
"When installing vLLM Ascend from source for A3, run `git submodule update "
"--init --recursive` manually or make sure that the environment has internet "
"access so the required submodules can be downloaded automatically."
msgstr ""
"在 A3 上从源码安装 vLLM Ascend 时，请手动运行 `git submodule update --init "
"--recursive`，或确保环境可以访问互联网，以便自动下载所需的子模块。"

msgid "Install vLLM first, then install vLLM Ascend:"
msgstr "首先安装 vLLM，然后安装 vLLM Ascend："

msgid "??? tip \"Clear the cache if uv installation fails\""
msgstr "??? tip \"如果 uv 安装失败，请清除缓存\""

msgid "=== \"pip installation\""
msgstr "=== \"pip 安装\""

msgid "=== \"uv installation\""
msgstr "=== \"uv 安装\""

msgid "=== \"source installation\""
msgstr "=== \"源码安装\""
